              recorded committee vote where required, posted to the troop portal
              with a named maintainer. The bars count only the pass conditions in
              each goal's approved measurable. Events and milestones that show a
              process working are listed under each goal but don't count.
            </p>
            <p class="wb-small wb-pathfinder">
              <strong>Lined up with the council's Pathfinder program.</strong>
              Goals 1 through 4 produce the four plans Twin Rivers Council asks
              units for: a membership plan (Goal 1), the annual calendar
              (Goal 2), a succession plan (Goal 3) and a budget (Goal 4).
            </p>
            <div class="wb-cards">
              {goals.map((g) => {
                const p = progress(g);
                return (
                  <a class="wb-card" href={`#${g.id}`}>
                    <span class="wb-card__top">
                      <span class="wb-card__n">Goal {g.n}</span>
                      <span class={`wb-chip wb-chip--${g.badge.kind}`}>{g.badge.label}</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="wb-card__title">{g.title}</span>
                    <span class="wb-card__due">Due {g.due}</span>
                    <span class="wb-bar" role="img" aria-label={`${p.done} of ${p.total} pass conditions met, ${p.pend} in progress`}>
                      <span style={`width:${p.pct}%`}></span>
                      <span class="wb-bar__part" style={`width:${p.pendPct}%`}></span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="wb-card__count">
                      <strong>{p.done} of {p.total} met{p.pend > 0 && `, ${p.pend} in progress`}.</strong>{p.milesTotal > 0 && ` ${p.milesDone} of ${p.milesTotal} milestones done.`} {g.next}.
                    </span>
                  </a>
                );
              })}
            </div>

            <h3 class="wb-h3">Coming up</h3>
            <div class="wb-table">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr><th scope="col">When</th><th scope="col">What happens</th><th scope="col">Status</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {comingUp.map((r) => (
                    <tr>
                      <td>{r.item}</td>
                      <td>{r.evidence}</td>
                      <td><span class={`wb-chip wb-chip--${r.kind}`}>{r.status}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </section>

          {/* Goals */}
          {goals.map((g) => (
            <section id={g.id} class="wb-sec">
              <div class="wb-head">
                <p class="wb-label">Goal {g.n} &middot; due {g.due}</p>
