              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="wb-h3">Public sites &middot; troop3054.org and pack3054.org</h3>
                <ul class="wb-list">
                  <li>The two sites point to each other: "Ages 11 to 17? Visit Troop 3054" and "Visit Pack 3054"</li>
                  <li>Every Join path ends at Scouting America's own application</li>
                  <li>The pack's leader app updates the pack website and families' calendars with no publishing step</li>
                  <li>A Committee &amp; Governance page publishes meeting dates, agendas and minutes</li>
                  <li>Drawings instead of photos of children on the pack site</li>
