              The portal holds youth information, so it appears here in dated
              screenshots rather than through reviewer accounts. A live
              walkthrough is <a href="#on-request">available on request</a>.
            </p>
          </section>

          {/* How the ticket was shaped */}
          <section id="shaped" class="wb-sec">
            <div class="wb-head">
              <p class="wb-label">Reviews</p>
              <h2 class="wb-h2">How the ticket was shaped</h2>
            </div>
            <ol class="wb-timeline">
              {timeline.map(([when, what]) => (
                <li>
                  <p class="wb-timeline__when">{when}</p>
                  <p class="wb-body">{what}</p>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ol>
            <h3 class="wb-h3">Drafting rules the ticket kept</h3>
            <ul class="wb-list">
              {draftingRules.map((r) => <li>{r}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </section>

          {/* Next cycle */}
          <section id="next-year" class="wb-sec">
            <div class="wb-head">
              <p class="wb-label">The next cycle</p>
              <h2 class="wb-h2">Who runs it next year</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="wb-lede">
              The proof of the vision is that each process repeats on its own
              schedule, with someone other than the Committee Chair named on it.
            </p>
            <div class="wb-table">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr><th scope="col">Recurring step</th><th scope="col">Owner</th><th scope="col">When</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {nextCycle.map(([step, owner, when]) => (
                    <tr>
                      <td>{step}</td>
                      <td>{owner}</td>
                      <td>{when}</td>
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </section>

          {/* On request */}
          <section id="on-request" class="wb-sec">
            <div class="wb-request">
              <p class="wb-label">For reviewers</p>
              <h2 class="wb-h2">Available on request</h2>
              <p class="wb-body">
                Some of the evidence names individual volunteers or families, or
                shows the troop's accounts, so it is not on this page. Any of it
                is available to my ticket counselor and course director:
              </p>
              <ul class="wb-list">
                <li>The line-by-line 2026-27 troop budget, with the Treasurer's actuals</li>
                <li>The adult positions summary and the portal's roles matrix, with names</li>
                <li>A live walkthrough of the member portal</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="wb-body">
                Ask at <a href="mailto:will@willmau.com">will@willmau.com</a>.
              </p>
              <p class="wb-small">Scout names and faces are not shown. Screenshots were taken {asOf}.</p>
              <p class="wb-small wb-credits">
                Image credits, via Wikimedia Commons: Wood Badge and woggle by
                Hideyuki Kamon, <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Japanese_Wood_Badge_and_woggle.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-SA 2.0</a>,
                background removed; MacLaren tartan by SGT141,
                <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MacLaren_Tartan.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>;
                <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wood_badge_regalia_1.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wood Badge regalia</a> by Gadget850 and
                <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:First_Wood_Badge_training_Gilwell_Park_September_1919.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the 1919 Gilwell photo</a>,
                public domain.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <SiteFooter />
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .wb {
    --wb-done: #2f6b4b;
    --wb-done-bg: #e2efe6;
    --wb-pend: #7a5200;
    --wb-pend-bg: #f8ecd0;
    --wb-sched: var(--ink);
    --wb-sched-bg: #e4e7f3;
    --wb-tan: #b0956a;
    background: var(--paper);
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 1rem + 4vw, 4rem) clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 5rem);
  }

  /* Wood Badge palette: Gilwell green, neckerchief tan, bead gold, and the
     MacLaren tartan from the neckerchief patch. */
  .wb-page {
    --wb-forest: #1c3a2a;
    --wb-forest-deep: #10241a;
    --wb-cream: #f6efe0;
    --wb-cream-soft: rgba(246, 239, 224, 0.74);
    --wb-gold: #dcb862;
    --wb-tartan: url('../images/woodbadge/maclaren-tartan.jpg') center / 120px repeat, #1f4a32;
  }

  /* Hero banner */
  .wb-banner {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 17rem;
    gap: 1rem 2.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2.6vw, 3.4rem) clamp(1.4rem, 0.8rem + 3vw, 3.4rem) clamp(1.6rem, 1.2rem + 1.6vw, 2.4rem);
    color: var(--wb-cream);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 84% 42%, rgba(240, 180, 94, 0.32), transparent 26rem),
      linear-gradient(140deg, var(--wb-forest) 0%, var(--wb-forest-deep) 100%);
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -18px rgba(16, 36, 26, 0.55);
  }
  .wb-banner::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto 0;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--wb-tartan);
  }
  .wb-banner__kicker {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--wb-gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .wb-banner__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 3.6rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--wb-cream);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .wb-banner__note {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 58ch;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--wb-cream-soft);
  }
  .wb-banner__beads {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    align-self: center;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 16px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45));
  }

  .wb-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.9rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }
  .wb-meta dt {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--wb-gold);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .wb-meta dd {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--wb-cream);
  }

  /* The road to the beads */
  .wb-trail {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(246, 239, 224, 0.14);
  }
  .wb-trail__step {
    position: relative;
    padding-right: 1rem;
  }
  .wb-trail__step::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 8px;
    left: 26px;
    right: 8px;
    height: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: rgba(246, 239, 224, 0.18);
  }
  .wb-trail__step:last-child::after { display: none; }
  .wb-trail__step--done::after { background: var(--wb-gold); }
  .wb-trail__dot {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 3px;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(246, 239, 224, 0.4);
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }
  .wb-trail__step--done .wb-trail__dot {
    background: var(--wb-gold);
    border-color: var(--wb-gold);
  }
  .wb-trail__step--now .wb-trail__dot {
    border-color: var(--wb-gold);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(220, 184, 98, 0.55);
    animation: wb-pulse 2.2s var(--ease) infinite;
  }
  .wb-trail__step--next .wb-trail__dot {
    width: auto;
    height: 18px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
  .wb-trail__bead {
    width: 7px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #5a3519, #d6a66b 45%, #7a4c24);
  }
  .wb-trail__label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--wb-cream);
  }
  .wb-trail__when {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--wb-cream-soft);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
  @keyframes wb-pulse {
    0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(220, 184, 98, 0.55); }
    70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(220, 184, 98, 0); }
    100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(220, 184, 98, 0); }
  }

  /* Layout */
  .wb__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 12.5rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }
  .wb__main { min-width: 0; }

  .wb-toc {
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
    align-self: start;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .wb-toc__label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }
  .wb-toc ol {
    list-style: none;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--line);
  }
  .wb-toc a {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding: 0.32rem 0 0.32rem 0.9rem;
    margin-left: -2px;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.35;
    transition: color 0.16s var(--ease), border-color 0.16s var(--ease);
  }
  .wb-toc a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-left-color: var(--green);
  }
  .wb-toc__n {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /* Sections and type */
  .wb-sec {
    padding-block: 2.6rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    scroll-margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .wb-sec:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }

  .wb-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .wb-head .wb-label { flex-basis: 100%; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .wb-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .wb-h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 1.25rem + 1vw, 2.1rem);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .wb-h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 2.1rem 0 0.8rem;
  }
  .wb-lede {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    max-width: 66ch;
  }
  .wb-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }
  .wb-body a,
  .wb-small a,
  .wb-request-note a {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--green);
  }
  .wb-small {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
  }

  .wb-prose p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1rem + 0.3vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 64ch;
  }
  .wb-prose p + p { margin-top: 1.1rem; }
  .wb-pull {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 1.1rem + 0.8vw, 1.7rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 30ch;
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--green);
  }

  /* Status chips */
  .wb-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.3;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .wb-chip::before {
    content: '';
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .wb-chip--done { color: var(--wb-done); background: var(--wb-done-bg); }
  .wb-chip--pend { color: var(--wb-pend); background: var(--wb-pend-bg); }
  .wb-chip--sched { color: var(--wb-sched); background: var(--wb-sched-bg); }

  /* Status cards */
  .wb-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
    gap: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }
  .wb-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: calc(1.1rem + 6px) 1.15rem 1.15rem;
    background: var(--paper-pure);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.18s var(--ease), transform 0.18s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.18s var(--ease);
  }
  .wb-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto 0;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--wb-tartan);
  }
  .wb-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(29, 34, 71, 0.25);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px -14px rgba(16, 36, 26, 0.45);
  }
  .wb-card__top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .wb-card__n {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }
  .wb-card__title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .wb-card__due,
  .wb-card__count {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .wb-card__count strong { color: var(--ink); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .wb-bar {
    display: block;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--wb-sched-bg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .wb-bar { display: flex; }
  .wb-bar span {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--green);
  }
  .wb-bar .wb-bar__part {
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(77, 155, 113, 0.5) 0 4px, rgba(77, 155, 113, 0.22) 4px 8px);
  }
  .wb-ev-link {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--green);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Measurable box */
  .wb-measure {
